  "v": 11,
  "label": "a listing carrying another body at the revision the base holds is a remote edit, pulled",
  "note": "the base holds c1 at r1 and nothing is staged. The server edited the card without moving its ETag: the listing names r1 again and carries c2. A carried body differing from the one the base holds at its own revision is a remote edit, read as a revision the base does not hold: pulled, the item and the base taking c2 at r1, its summary and sort key c2's, reported ContentChanged. Reading the revision alone would leave c1 under c2's summary, or hide the edit until the ETag moves (SYNC.md section 5, A carried body is a remote edit under an unmoved revision)",
